            "spec": {
              "description": "**A worked example, small enough to read in one sitting.**\n\nThree blocks, one flow, one saved request and one suite — a person\ndrops a parcel into a locker and the ledger learns about it.\n\nNothing here is a real system. What is real is the *shape*: every file in\nthis design is byte-for-byte what the emitter renders, which is what makes\nthe directory usable as a fixture as well as an example.\n",
